        <data key="n_url">matrix.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">m : _Expression
__ jordan(A) → [[P, J]] __
A = P·J·P⁻¹ (diagonalizable matrices)
exact, rational eigenvalues → exact form, blocks included (F_0176)
defective numeric → stays symbolic
result: Left(_Matrix(1,2,...))</data>
    </node>
