assembleBlocks: conformity + MaxMatrixCells,
then one _Matrix -&gt; dense / exact / symbolic
_HCat _VCat _BlkDiag _RepMat _Kron _SubMatrix
submatrix: 1-based, inclusive (the at convention)</data>
