    <node id="n124">
        <data key="n_label">LaplaceTransform</data>
        <data key="n_package">transform</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ laplaceOf(e, t, s): _Expression
__ rules __
constants, t^n, exp(ct)
sin(wt), cos(wt), linearity
first-shift e^{at}g(t) -&gt; G(s-a)
step u(t) -&gt; 1/s
2nd-shift u(t-a)g(t-a) -&gt; e^{-as}G(s)
deriv-of-xfm t^n*g(t) -&gt; (-1)^n d^n G/ds^n</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n125">
        <data key="n_label">FourierTransform</data>
        <data key="n_package">transform</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ fourierOf(e, t, w): _Expression
+ causalFourierOf(e, t, w): _Expression
+ fourierDecline(e, t, w, causal): Option[String]
__ F_0141 __
L{x}(iw) + L{x(-t)}(-iw), each read on t &gt; 0
declines a pole on or right of the axis
unless it cancels in the whole transform</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n126">
        <data key="n_label">InverseLaplaceTransform</data>
        <data key="n_package">transform</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ inverseLaplaceOf(f, s, t): _Expression
__ rational N(s)/D(s), deg D = 1 or 2 __
linearity, b/(s-a) -&gt; b*e^{at}
partial fractions (distinct roots)
repeated + complex poles (complete the square)
__ deg D &gt;= 3, repeated poles included (3.17) __
multiplicities from squareFreeFactors
numerators by undetermined coefficients
A/(s-r)^k -&gt; A t^(k-1) e^(rt) / (k-1)!
repeated irreducible quadratic, k &gt;= 3: declined
__ second-shift __
e^{-as}*F(s) -&gt; u(t-a)*f(t-a)</data>
    </node>
