    <node id="n129">
        <data key="n_label">ZTransform</data>
        <data key="n_package">transform</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ zTransformOf(x, n, z): _Expression
constant -&gt; c*z/(z-1), NOT the Laplace c/s
step, geometric a^n -&gt; z/(z-a), exp(c*n),
sin / cos, linearity
n*x[n] -&gt; -z dX/dz  (supplies n, n^2, n*a^n)
no Kronecker delta: core has no node for it</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n130">
        <data key="n_label">InverseZTransform</data>
        <data key="n_package">transform</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ inverseZTransformOf(f, z, n): _Expression
decomposes X(z)/z, NOT X(z)
z/(z-r)^j -&gt; binom(n, j-1) r^(n-j+1)
multiplicities from squareFreeFactors
complex poles: declined</data>
    </node>
