        <data key="n_members">rhs      : _Expression
depVar   : _Variable
indepVar : _Variable
t0       : _Expression
y0       : _Expression
target   : _Expression
__ ode(rhs, y, t, t0, y0, target) __
y' = rhs(t, y), y(t0) = y0 ; value y(target)</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n133">
        <data key="n_label">SolveODE</data>
        <data key="n_package">ode</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ solveODE(rhs, y, t, t0, y0, target, env): Option[Double]
+ stepCount(span, precision): Int
__ RK4 __
steps: floor + interval-scaled + precision, capped
signed h -&gt; backward integration
tree-eval f(t, y) per stage</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n134">
        <data key="n_label">SolveODESymbolic</data>
        <data key="n_package">ode</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ solveODESymbolic(...): Option[_Expression]
__ constant-coeff linear y' = a*y + b __
a*y      -&gt; y0*e^{a(t-t0)}
b        -&gt; y0 + b*(t-t0)
a*y + b  -&gt; (y0 + b/a)*e^{a(t-t0)} - b/a
__ variable-coeff linear y' = a(t)*y + b(t) __
integrating factor mu = e^{-integral a dt}
y = (Q(target) - Q(t0) + y0*mu(t0)) / mu(target)
with Q = integral(mu*b dt)</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n135">
        <data key="n_label">SolveODESystem</data>
        <data key="n_package">ode</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ solveODESystem(...): Option[_MatrixValue]
__ constant-coeff linear system y' = A*y + b, y0 an n x 1 column __
exp([[A, b], [0, 0]]*tau) = [[Phi, Gamma], [0, 1]]
y(target) = Phi*y0 + Gamma
declines A(t), b(t), non-conforming shapes, symbolic tau</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n136">
        <data key="n_label">VectorODE</data>
        <data key="n_package">ode</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">calculus.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ odeCertified(...): Either[OdeFailure, Vector[Double]]
+ odeStep(...) / odeSolve(...)
__ F_0051: time-varying and nonlinear systems __
OdeState: Whole(y) | Components([[x], [v]])
OdeMethod: Euler | RK4 | RK45 (Dormand-Prince)
ode: RK4, n and 2n steps must agree (certificate)
odeStep/odeSolve: uncertified, the step is the caller's</data>
    </node>
