        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">logic.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ asTruth(v, symmetric): Option[Double]
_Bool -&gt; 1/0 ; _Truth -&gt; d
symmetric: also -1 / 0 / 1 (issue 4.G)
+ asDegree(v, symmetric): Option[Double]
wider: any number in [0,1] (membership domain)
+ isCrisp(e, symmetric): Boolean
no graded value; digit 0 and _Membership are graded
__ kernels, curried on the semantics __
kleeneAnd(s) = min / a*b / max(0,a+b-1)
kleeneOr(s)  = max / a+b-a*b / min(1,a+b)
kleeneNot    = 1 - a  (shared)
kleeneImplies(s), kleeneXor(s)
__ shared min-max rule table __
kleeneAnd = min ; kleeneOr = max
kleeneNot = 1 - a
kleeneImplies = max(1 - a, b)
kleeneXor = max(min(a,1-b), min(1-a,b))</data>
    </node>
