        <data key="n_stereotype">object</data>
        <data key="n_url">control.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">stateSpace(A,B,C,D) -&gt; 1 x 4 _Matrix
the lu/qr/eig shape: at(m,1,k) and :save
come free, no new carrier
controllable(A, B) via ctrb + full row rank
rank = M'.qrDecompose.isDefined, NOT
det(M*M') &gt; eps: the Gram form squares
the condition number and a determinant
scales like ||M||^(2n), so the verdict
would depend on the model's UNITS
observable(A, C) = controllable(A', C')
DEFINED by duality, never restated
c2dExact(A, B, Ts): expm([[A,B],[0,0]]*Ts)
NOT A^-1 (A_d - I) B -- the block form is
defined for a SINGULAR A, and any system
with an integrator has one</data>
    </node>
