        <data key="n_members">__ F_0066: min f, g &lt;= 0, h = 0, bounds __
nlpSolve(f, vars, x0, g, h, bounds, method, env)
SQP: a qpSolve per step, damped BFGS (B stays
positive definite), l1 merit + second-order correction
AugLag: PHR, its own projected BFGS inside
ONE certificate: scale-free KKT residual; a LOCAL point
Left(NlpFailure) / Right(NlpResult incl. multipliers)
MaxNlpVariables 100, MaxNlpIterations 200 (measured)</data>
    </node>
