+ scan(roots): Vector
__ __
a cp1252 round trip INVERTED
CharToByte built with REPORT, so the five
slots cp1252 leaves undefined are found
and passed through (⁻¹ depends on 0x81)
Lossy: damage that lost a byte outright
fixpoint: some text was damaged twice
plausible(): the repair is NOT injective</data>
