        <data key="n_package">tools</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">object</data>
        <data key="n_url">developer.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ offences(roots): (Vector, Int)
every relative link and asset under docs/src
must resolve, in the right letter CASE
(mdoc only warns; Linux 404s a case slip)
the one guard NOT defaulting to GuardedRoots</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n255">
        <data key="n_label">CheckCsp</data>
        <data key="n_package">tools</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">object</data>
        <data key="n_url">developer.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ offences(page): Vector
web/index.html's policy lists every inline
script's SHA-256, no stale hash, no unsafe
script source, one-line scripts (F_0112)</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n256">
        <data key="n_label">PumlGraph</data>
        <data key="n_package">tools</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">object</data>
        <data key="n_url">developer.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ read(text): Either[Vector, Diagram]
+ toGraphML(d): String
+ offences(source, target): Vector
this diagram as GraphML for Gephi (F_0097);
refuses what it does not know, and a
stale committed structure.graphml</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n257">
        <data key="n_label">Files</data>
        <data key="n_package">tools</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">developer.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ GuardedRoots: Vector
+ rootsOrDefault(args): Vector
walk / read / write / report
__ __
ONE definition of which files a guard covers
(F_0028): the alias passes no paths, the
suites read the constant, so the list that
was written three times — and missed the
four CrossType.Pure platform trees — is
written once</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n258">
        <data key="n_label">ToLatex</data>
        <data key="n_package">latex</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">object</data>
        <data key="n_url">repl.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">+ apply(e: _Expression): String
__ __
precedence: Grouped &lt; AtSum &lt; AtProduct
&lt; AtPower &lt; Atomic
Grouped = a slot LaTeX already delimits,
so (a+b)/(c+d) -&gt; \\frac{a + b}{c + d}
Power reports below Atomic: x^{2}^{3}
is a LaTeX ERROR, not a style choice
__ extractors __
Negated  : a - b is Sum(a, (-1)*b)
Root     : x^0.5 / x^(1/2) / _Rational
Transformed : the five L / F / Z shapes
__ fallback __
no rule -&gt; \\mathrm{escaped toString}</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n259">
        <data key="n_label">Session</data>
        <data key="n_package">cli</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">utility</data>
        <data key="n_url">repl.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">- precision: Int
- colorSchemeName: String
- bindings: Map
- definitions: Map
+ execute(line: String): String
+ lastLatex: Option[String]
+ currentColorScheme: String
+ settings: List[(String, String)]
+ script: String
+ load(text: String): String
__ companion __
ReservedConstants: Set = {pi, e}
+ loadFile(session, path): String
+ saveFile(session, path): String
+ step(session, line): Option</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n260">
        <data key="n_label">ColorScheme</data>
        <data key="n_package">cli</data>
        <data key="n_kind">class</data>
        <data key="n_stereotype">data</data>
        <data key="n_url">repl.html</data>
        <data key="n_members">command / function / constant
number / operator / equation
paren / variable: AttributedStyle
__ companion __
Dark / Light / Plain schemes
All: Map[String, ColorScheme]
+ named(name): ColorScheme</data>
    </node>
